@startuml

title Outbox Pattern：Domain Event → Outbox → Background Job

participant "Application Layer" as App
participant "Aggregate" as Agg
participant "IPublisher\n(CoreMesh)" as Publisher
participant "EventHandler" as Handler
participant "DbContext" as DB
participant "OutboxEvent\nTable" as Outbox
database "PostgreSQL" as PG
participant "BackgroundJob\n(Consumer)" as Job
participant "External Service\n(Email / Redis / ES)" as External

== 生產者：Application Layer 發送 Domain Event ==

App -> Agg : 呼叫業務方法\n(e.g. MarkAsShipped)
Agg -> Agg : 更新狀態
Agg -> Agg : RaiseDomainEvent(XxxEvent)

App -> App : 收集 aggregate.DomainEvents
App -> Publisher : Publish(XxxEvent)
Publisher -> Handler : Handle(XxxEvent, ct)

note over Handler, Outbox
    Handler 與 Application Layer 共用同一個 DbContext（Scoped）
    所以此時 OutboxEvent 加入 DbContext 但尚未 commit
end note

Handler -> DB : OutboxEvents.Add(\n  OutboxEvent.Create("XxxEvent", payload)\n)
Handler --> Publisher : done

App -> Agg : ClearDomainEvents()
App -> DB : SaveChangesAsync()

note over DB, PG
    同一個 Transaction：
    - Aggregate 狀態變更
    - OutboxEvent（Status: Pending）
    一起 commit，保證一致性
end note

DB -> PG : BEGIN TRANSACTION
DB -> PG : UPDATE aggregates ...
DB -> PG : INSERT outbox_events ...
PG --> DB : commit OK
DB --> App : done

== 消費者：Background Job 處理 Outbox 事件 ==

loop 每隔 N 秒輪詢
    Job -> PG : SELECT * FROM outbox_events\nWHERE status = 'Pending'\nORDER BY created_at\nLIMIT 10

    alt 沒有 Pending 事件
        Job -> Job : 等待下一輪
    else 有 Pending 事件
        loop 每筆 OutboxEvent
            Job -> External : 執行副作用\n(寄 email / 清 Redis / Index ES / 更新 Order)

            alt 執行成功
                Job -> PG : UPDATE outbox_events\nSET status = 'Processed', processed_at = now()
            else 執行失敗
                Job -> PG : UPDATE outbox_events\nSET retry_count = retry_count + 1

                alt retry_count >= 3
                    Job -> PG : UPDATE outbox_events\nSET status = 'Failed'
                    note right : 人工介入或告警
                end
            end
        end
    end
end

@enduml
